## <a name="example-contract-for-arraylist-add-method"></a>ArrayList Add 方法的合约示例

此合约定义了添加元素到集合中的操作。 它假设集合中的元素数量(Old_count)在添加元素后增加了1。

```csharp
[PexMethod]
[PexContractReference(nameof(ArrayList.Add))]
public void AddContract([PexAssumeUnderTest] ArrayList arrList, int value)
{
    AssumePrecondition.IsTrue(arrList.Count >= 0); // The list is not null.
    AssumePrecondition.IsFalse(arrList.Contains(value)); // The value is not already in the list.

    int Old_count = arrList.Count;

    arrList.Add(value);

    int New_count = arrList.Count;

    Assert.AreEqual(Old_count + 1, New_count); // The count should have increased by 1.
    Assert.IsTrue(arrList.Contains(value));    // The value should be in the list.
}
```

此外，还有其他内置属性，例如`PexMembership`、`PexObserve`和`PexInstrumentationProvider`，可以帮助您的测试更精确和全面。

