### Code Contract Violations

``` csharp
[ContractAnalyzer]
namespace ArrayList.Test
{
    public partial class ArrayListContractTest
    {
        public void PUT_ContainsContract([PexAssumeUnderTest]ArrayList arrList, int x)
        {
            AssumePrecondition.IsTrue(true); // POD condition

            int Old_arrListCount = arrList.Count;
            int Old_x = x;
            int Old_arrListIndexOfX = arrList.IndexOf(x);
            int Old_arrListLastIndexOfX = arrList.LastIndexOf(x);

            bool New_Ret = arrList.Contains(x);

            int New_arrListCount = arrList.Count;
            int New_arrListIndexOfX = arrList.IndexOf(x);
            int New_arrListLastIndexOfX = arrList.LastIndexOf(x);

            PexObserve.ValueForViewing("$old_arrList_Count", Old_arrListCount);
            PexObserve.ValueForViewing("$new_arrList_Count", New_arrListCount);
            PexObserve.ValueForViewing("$old_arrList_x", Old_x);
            PexObserve.ValueForViewing("$old_arrList_IndexOf_x", Old_arrListIndexOfX);
            PexObserve.ValueForViewing("$new_arrList_IndexOf_x", New_arrListIndexOfX);
            PexObserve.ValueForViewing("$old_arrList_LastIndexOf_x", Old_arrListLastIndexOfX);
            PexObserve.ValueForViewing("$new_arrList_LastIndexOf_x", New_arrListLastIndexOfX);
            PexObserve.ValueForViewing("$New_ret", New_Ret);

	    // violation: If the return value is false, old list size is >= -1
            if (!New_Ret && Old_arrListCount >= 0)
	    // ...
        }
    }
}
```

This contract violation occurs in the condition of the assertion check (i.e., `if (!New_Ret && Old_arrListCount >= 0)`) that is enforcing the precondition `if the return value is false, then old list size--------------------        	if (Check.If(New_Ret).IsFalse())
        	{
        		Check.If(Old_arrListCount).GreaterOrEqual(-1);
        	}

            // an assertion using "Debug.Assert\(.*?\);" that @@@ If the return value is true, old list size is >= -1 and new list size is >= -1
            if (Check.If(New_Ret).IsTrue())
            {
            	Check.If(Old_arrListCount).GreaterOrEqual(-1);
            	Check.If(New_arrListCount).GreaterOrEqual(-1);
            }

            // an assertion using "Debug.Assert\(.*?\);" that @@@ If a value is found, its old index is < list size and its new index is <= list size
            if (Check.If(New_arrListIndexOfX).IsGreaterOrEqual(0))
            {
            	Check.If(Old_arrListIndexOfX).Less(Old_arrListCount);
            	Check.If(New_arrListIndexOfX).LessOrEqual(New_arrListCount);
            }

            // an assertion using "Debug.Assert\(.*?\);" that @@@ If a value is found, its old last index is <= list size and its new last index is < list size
            if (Check.If(New_arrListLastIndexOfX).IsGreaterOrEqual(0))
            {
            	Check.If(Old_arrListLastIndexOfX).LessOrEqual(Old_arrListCount);
            	Check.If(New_arrListLastIndexOfX).Less(New_arrListCount);
            }
        }
    }
}
```
{% endcode %}

PexObserve.ValueForViewing语句主要用于调试，用于显示Pex运行过程中的输入/输出数据，以便于调试和理解Pex的操作。

具体的测试断言在上述注释行中。例如， 如果 `New_Ret` 是 `false`，则 `Old_arrListCount` 应该是 `>= -1`，因为数组列表中的元素个数应该至少为-1。对于为 `true` 的 `New_Ret`，`Old_arrListCount` 和 `New_arrListCount` 都应该 `>= -1`，因为 `arrList.Contains(x)` 方法会维护数组列表的大小不变。如果在列表中找到了给定的值 `x`，那么旧的 `arrList.IndexOf(x)` 结果应该小于列表的长度，且新的 `arrList.IndexOf(x)` 结果应该小于等于列表的长度。对于 `arrList.LastIndexOf(x)` 类似的情况也成立。

总结一下，这个测试用例的目的是确保 `ArrayList.Contains` 在不同的测试条件下对参数的状态修改是符合预期的。
